==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|vera||to be}} and {{m|is|með||with}}.

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|var|voru|verið|11=með}}

# {{label|is|with accusative}} to [[have]]{{jump|is|have|s}}
#: ''Ég '''er með''' popp.''
#:: I '''have''' popcorn.
# {{label|is|with dative|or|elliptically}} to [[take part]] in, to [[join]]{{jump|is|take part|s}}
#: ''Má ég '''vera með'''?''
#:: Can I '''join'''?

====Synonyms====
* {{jump|s|is|have}} [[hafa]]
* {{jump|s|is|take part}} [[að vera memm]] (childish)

